	(text "3.3 V (AP2112K) for the CAN transceiver only; the pod makes its own 3.3 V.\n5V_POD: the pod's supply up the cable, through F2, a 500 mA resettable fuse,\nso a short in the cable cannot take down this board's 5 V.\nLiDAR: 12 V through its own 3 A fuse F3 to the M12 socket."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 25.4 0)
